sition:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<h4 id=\"컴포넌트-생명-주기-component-lifecycle\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%EB%84%8C%ED%8A%B8-%EC%83%9D%EB%AA%85-%EC%A3%BC%EA%B8%B0-component-lifecycle\" aria-label=\"컴포넌트 생명 주기 component lifecycle permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>컴포넌트 생명 주기 (Component Lifecycle)</h4>\n<p>: 생성(mounting) → 업데이트(updating) → 제거(unmounting)  </p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"mount\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#mount\" aria-label=\"mount permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>mount</h2>\n<p>: 컴포넌트가 생성될 때  </p>\n<br>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">componentDidMount</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">useEffect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token comment\">// 컴포넌트가 화면에 가장 처음 렌더링됐을 때에만 실행하고 싶을 때</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"update\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#update\" aria-label=\"update permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>update</h2>\n<p>: 컴포넌트가 업데이트 될 때</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">props</code>가 바뀔 때</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">state</code>가 바뀔 때</li>\n<li>부모 컴포넌트가 <code class=\"language-text\">리렌더링</code>될 때</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">forceUpdate</code>로 강제로 렌더링 트리거할 때</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">componentDidUpdate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prevProps<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> prevState<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> snapshot<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">useEffect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token comment\">// 특정 값이 업데이트될 때마다 실행하고 싶을 때</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>email<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> password<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 이 배열을 useEffect의 dependency array라고 부름</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"unmount\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#unmount\" aria-label=\"unmount permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>unmount</h2>\n<p>: 컴포넌트가 사라질 때  </p>\n<br>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">componentWillUnmount</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">useEffect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token comment\">// 컴포넌트가 사라지기 직전에 특정 코드를 실행하고 싶을 때</span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>","excerpt":"라이프사이클 (Lifecycle)    컴포넌트 생명 주기 (Component Lifecycle) : 생성(mounting) → 업데이트(updating) → 제거(unmounting)    mount : 컴포넌트가 생성될 때    update : 컴포넌트가 업데이트 될 때 가 바뀔 때 가 바뀔 때 부모 컴포넌트가 될 때 로 강제로 렌더링 트리거할 때  unmount : 컴포넌트가 사라질 때","frontmatter":{"date":"September 14, 2023","title":"[Web] React - 라이프사이클","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/React/lifecycle/"}},"next":{"id":"16482cc1-704a-5245-b8c1-ce1f4b4b081f","html":"<h1 id=\"라이프사이클-메서드-lifecycle-method\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%ED%94%84%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%ED%81%B4-%EB%A9%94%EC%84%9C%EB%93%9C-lifecycle-method\" aria-label=\"라이프사이클 메서드 lifecycle method permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>라이프사이클 메서드 (Lifecycle Method)</h1>\n<br>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 52.222222222222214%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"컴포넌트 생명 주기\"\n        title=\"컴포넌트 생명 주기\"\n        src=\"/static/a4c6491a09a72cacf21fcc4e3b6d879f/37523/lifecycle.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/a4c6491a09a72cacf21fcc4e3b6d879f/e9ff0/lifecycle.png 180w,\n/static/a4c6491a09a72cacf21fcc4e3b6d879f/f21e7/lifecycle.png 360w,\n/static/a4c6491a09a72cacf21fcc4e3b6d879f/37523/lifecycle.png 720w,\n/static/a4c6491a09a72cacf21fcc4e3b6d879f/302a4/lifecycle.png 1080w,\n/static/a4c6491a09a72cacf21fcc4e3b6d879f/21b4d/lifecycle.png 1280w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"render\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#render\" aria-label=\"render permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>render</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>클래스 컴포넌트에서 반드시 구현돼야하는 유일한 메서드</li>\n<li>\n<p>메서드가 호출되면 <code class=\"language-text\">this.props</code>와 <code class=\"language-text\">this.state</code>의 값을 활용하여 아래의 것 중 하나를 반환</p>\n<ul>\n<li>React 엘리먼트</li>\n<li>배열과 Fragment</li>\n<li>Portal</li>\n<li>문자열과 숫자</li>\n<li>Booleans / null / undefined</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>컴포넌트의 state를 변경하지 않고, 호출될 때마다 동일한 결과 반환  </li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<h2 id=\"mount\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#mount\" aria-label=\"mount permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>mount</h2>\n<h3 id=\"constructor\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#constructor\" aria-label=\"constructor permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>constructor</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>메서드를 바인딩하거나 state를 초기화하는 작업이 없다면, 해당 React 컴포넌트에는 생성자를 구현하지 않아도 됨</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">this.state</code>에 객체를 할당하여 지역 state를 초기화</li>\n<li>인스턴트에 이벤트 처리 메서드를 바인딩  </li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<h3 id=\"componentdidmount\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#componentdidmount\" aria-label=\"componentdidmount permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>componentDidMount</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>컴포넌트가 마운트된 직후, 즉 트리에 삽입된 직후에 호출</li>\n<li>초기화 작업, 네트워크 요청하기 적절  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"update\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#update\" aria-label=\"update permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>update</h2>\n<h3 id=\"componentdidupdate\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#componentdidupdate\" aria-label=\"componentdidupdate permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>componentDidUpdate</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>갱신이 일어난 직후에 호출</li>\n<li>이전과 현재의 props를 비교하여 네트워크 요청할 때  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"unmount\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#unmount\" aria-label=\"unmount permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>unmount</h2>\n<h3 id=\"componentwillunmount\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#componentwillunmount\" aria-label=\"componentwillunmount permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>componentWillUnmount</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>컴포넌트가 마운트 해제되어 제거되기 직전에 호출</li>\n<li>타이머 제거, 네트워크 요청 취소, <code class=\"language-text\">componentDidMount()</code> 내에서 생성된 구독 해제</li>\n<li>다시 렌더링되지 않으므로, <code class=\"language-text\">componentWillUnmount()</code> 내에서 <code class=\"language-text\">setState()</code>를 호출 불가능</li>\n<li>컴포넌트 인스턴스가 마운트 해제되고 나면, 절대로 다시 마운트되지 않음  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://ko.legacy.reactjs.org/docs/react-component.html\">https://ko.legacy.reactjs.org/docs/react-component.html</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"September 14, 2023","title":"[Web] React - 라이프사이클 메서드","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/React/lifecycle_method/"}},"prev":{"id":"1460b69c-ec17-593b-a9f7-d6640890989d","html":"<h1 id=\"paging--segmentation\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#paging--segmentation\" aria-label=\"paging  segmentation permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Paging &#x26; Segmentation</h1>\n<br>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>외부 단편화</strong> : 물리적 메모리의 빈 공간으로 인해 발생하는 문제\n<strong>내부 단편화</strong> : 할당된 메모리의 내부 공간이 비효율적으로 사용되는 문제</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"paging\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#paging\" aria-label=\"paging permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Paging</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50.55555555555556%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"paging 기법\"\n        title=\"paging 기법\"\n        src=\"/static/6bdef6a533fc35d80556d2dbcd783156/37523/paging.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/6bdef6a533fc35d80556d2dbcd783156/e9ff0/paging.png 180w,\n/static/6bdef6a533fc35d80556d2dbcd783156/f21e7/paging.png 360w,\n/static/6bdef6a533fc35d80556d2dbcd783156/37523/paging.png 720w,\n/static/6bdef6a533fc35d80556d2dbcd783156/906b5/paging.png 950w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<p><strong>→ 프로세스의 주소 공간을 고정된 사이즈의 페이지 단위로 나누어 물리적 메모리에 불연속적으로 할당하는 방식</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>물리적 메모리를 고정된 크기 블록인 <strong><code class=\"language-text\">Frame</code></strong>으로 분할하고, 논리적 메모리를 동일한 크기의 <strong><code class=\"language-text\">Page</code></strong>로 분할</li>\n<li>논리적 주소를 페이지 번호와 오프셋으로 나타냄</li>\n<li>페이지와 프레임을 대응시키는 page mapping 과정 필요</li>\n<li>페이지 테이블에 각 페이지 번호와 해당 페이지가 할당된 프레임의 시작 물리 주소 저장</li>\n<li>구현이 간단하여 효율적인 메모리 사용 가능</li>\n<li>연속적이지 않은 공간도 활용할 수 있기 때문에 <strong>외부 단편화 문제 해결</strong></li>\n<li>프로세스의 크기가 페이지 크기의 배수가 아닐 경우 마지막 페이지에 <strong>내부 단편화 발생</strong>  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"segmentation\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#segmentation\" aria-label=\"segmentation permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Segmentation</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 53.333333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"segmentation 기법\"\n        title=\"segmentation 기법\"\n        src=\"/static/19711c638afaae8154263762355b9fef/37523/segmentation.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/19711c638afaae8154263762355b9fef/e9ff0/segmentation.png 180w,\n/static/19711c638afaae8154263762355b9fef/f21e7/segmentation.png 360w,\n/static/19711c638afaae8154263762355b9fef/37523/segmentation.png 720w,\n/static/19711c638afaae8154263762355b9fef/906b5/segmentation.png 950w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>    </p>\n<p><strong>→ 프로세스를 서로 크기가 다른 논리적인 블록 단위인 세그먼트로 분할하여 메모리에 연속적으로 할당하는 방식</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>메모리를 가변 크기의 <strong><code class=\"language-text\">segment</code></strong>로 분할</li>\n<li>각 세그먼트는 프로그램의 논리적 단위에 해당 (함수, 데이터 구조 등)</li>\n<li>논리적 주소는 세그먼트 번호와 오프셋으로 나타냄</li>\n<li>세그먼트의 크기가 서로 다르기에 프로세스가 메모리에 적재될 때 빈 공간을 찾아 할당</li>\n<li>mapping을 위한 segment table 필요</li>\n<li>프로세스가 필요한 메모리 공간만큼 메모리를 할당하기에 <strong>내부 단편화 발생 X</strong></li>\n<li>중간에 메모리를 해제하면 <strong>외부 단편화 발생</strong>  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://cocoon1787.tistory.com/860\">https://cocoon1787.tistory.com/860</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"September 26, 2023","title":"[CS] 운영체제 - Paging & Segmentation","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/paging_and_segmentation/"}},"site":{"siteMetadata":{"siteUrl":"https://www.jsh99.com","comments":{"utterances":{"repo":"JSH99/JSH99.github.io"}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/Web/React/lifecycle/","nextSlug":"/Web/React/lifecycle_method/","prevSlug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/paging_and_segmentation/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1073350324","2938748437"]}